5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to verify the actual costs before committing to any destination.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The administrative burden of last year was unsustainable for the organizers.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,We must consider how the location affects social cohesion among year groups.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Sleep quality directly impacts training performance, so accommodation is critical.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The flat fee structure hides individual financial disparities and dropout risks.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, what specific duties caused the most strain last time?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Cooking and logistics consumed most evenings, leaving no time for rest.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Ryuji, if we stay local, does that reduce the financial risk?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Asuka, how do we handle members who cannot afford extra costs?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,We need a clear policy on who covers the cost of late cancellations.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will look into the transport receipts and the public bed rates.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
