35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Transport is 38% of costs if we go far. Public beds are cheap at 1,100 yen.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The canteen closes, so we'd cook. The hall is booked by others, splitting our time.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,Seniors say mixing only happens in shared dorms. A fifth of members never attended.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,Inland centers have 8-person rooms and strict lights-out. The lottery is a nightmare.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,Whole-building deposits are non-refundable. A third of members can't make the 9am train.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Jonathan, the strict lights-out at inland centers sounds bad for recovery.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, if we stay on campus, we avoid the transport spike but lose the hall.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, if we can't get there by 9am, we need beds, which costs more.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, if a fifth don't come, is the trip even worth it?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, splitting training into early mornings and late evenings is inefficient.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"The public rate sheet is attractive, but the lottery risk is high.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,Cooking duty is a dealbreaker. We need a place with kitchen staff.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,Shared sleeping is essential for the social goal. We can't ignore that.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I need to know if the coastal lodge offers better sleep conditions.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The non-refundable deposit is a major financial risk for the club account.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
