60,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option A has a non-refundable deposit. Option B has no transport cost. Option C is cheap but risky.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option A has kitchen staff. Option B requires us to cook. Option C has strict rules.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Option A and C have shared rooms. Option B is separate, which kills the social goal.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Option A is new, so unknown. Option C has bad sleep reports. Option B is familiar.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A has high dropout risk. Option B has low dropout risk. Option C is middle.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, if we choose A, we must ensure everyone can afford the deposit.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, Option A solves the cooking problem, which is my main concern.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Jonathan, if A has shared rooms, it might fix the year-group issue.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, I need to know if the coastal lodge has quiet rooms.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, if we choose A, we need a clear policy for late cancellations.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I am leaning towards A, but the financial risk is high.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I prefer A because it removes the cooking burden.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minako,,I strongly prefer A for the social benefits.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
